Irregular triangle read by rows: the first row is 1, and the n-th row (n > 1) lists the factors f of n where n/f is prime (the maximal factors of n.)

The 78 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

